# Server-side line in the documentation host's authorized_keys.
# The pull key may only run git-upload-pack for one repository: no shell, no push,
# no port or agent forwarding, no terminal. Replace the key and the path.
#
# Edit authorized_keys one change at a time and keep a second session open until you
# have tested the new line; a single bad edit can lock out every key.

command="git-upload-pack '/srv/docs.git'",no-port-forwarding,no-X11-forwarding,no-agent-forwarding,no-pty ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIEXAMPLEEXAMPLEEXAMPLEEXAMPLEEXAMPLEEXAMPLEEXAMPL docs-pull-key
